@Catalog.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5101

### List products (ordered by Id)
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/products
Accept: application/json

### Get product by id
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Get unknown product (404)
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/products/9999
Accept: application/json
